node_modules
.next
.git
*.log
# CRITICAL — ui/Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so without this line ui/.env and
# ui/.env.local (NEXTAUTH_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET) are baked into an image
# layer that anyone able to pull the image can read, and that no later RUN can
# delete. Secrets must arrive at RUN time from the environment, never at BUILD
# time in a layer. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is passed as --build-arg instead.
.env*
out
__pycache__
*.tsbuildinfo
*.txt
